{"id":"u-5ad8414b-9c80-4c34-b5b2-5e098b57cc3b","src":"community","title":"Beef Cannon Generator","author":"Tal R.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/nCOMvD-arms-and-delt-emphasis","desc":"This is a fridge assembly guide. The program focuses on general strength for all movement patterns with medium low reps on compounds and lots of isolations to create beef cannon arms and boulder shoulders alongside preserving or even growing the torso and leg muscles.\nThe sets written are not final and open to change for your goals and volume tolerance\nThis program is inspired by geoffrey verity schofield the natty arms goat 🐐.\n\nThe program uses double progression on all movements, undulating between intensity and volume requiring less deloads in the long term and maybe producing less soreness overall.\nDon't be worried if you're not super sore the first couple of weeks, it will catch up to you.\n\nEat to support your training, this program is pretty high volume and requires some work capacity.\nThe supersets written are meant as alternating the movements and resting between them, so dont just superset compunds, the isolations are more forgiving. \n\nGood luck to anyone trying it.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:36:08.416Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest & Delt Emphasis","Quad & Glute Emphasis","Chest & Arms Emphasis","Ham & Traps Emphasis","Arms & Delts Emphasiss"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Close Grip)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Neutral Grip, Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"AD Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Spider Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"x":2}],"note":"8-10, Partials till 15"},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"x":2}],"note":"8-10, Par